=== crlf, width 80, default
Constructs that change with the parser

Reference links: full the text (https://example.com/reference), collapsed r1
(https://example.com/reference), shortcut r1 (https://example.com/reference) and
undefined [text][nope].

Reference image: [image: alt text] (https://example.com/image.png) and [image:
img] (https://example.com/image.png) and undefined ![alt][nope].

A footnote reference and another, referenced in reverse order of the definitions
below.

Text between the definitions.

┌───┬───┐
│ a │ b │
├───┼───┤
│ 1 │ 2 │
├───┼───┤
│ 4 │   │
└───┴───┘

☑ 
☐ 
☐ 
☑ with text

Autolink literals: ftp://example.com/file, [ https://example.com after a
bracket, WWW.example.com, [a]www.example.com, https://example.com/a] and
www.example.com] (http://www.example.com]).

The first footnote, written first.

The second footnote, with a link (https://example.com).
